us="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OGAWA FUMINOBU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SEKIGUCHI SHUNICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMADA YOSHIHISA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ASAI, KOHTARO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASEGAWA, YURI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISU, YOSHIMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KURODA, SHINICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NISHIKAWA, HIROFUMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OGAWA, FUMINOBU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SEKIGUCHI, SHUNICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMADA, YOSHIHISA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An image decoder expands compressed image data in units of a predetermined block by inverse orthogonal conversion. It has error-block detection means (error-block detection section (4)) for checking whether block data contains an error by using a given image signal and threshold in a frequency region, and outputting an error detection state of the block data.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un décodeur d'image qui décomprime des données image comprimées pour former des unités correspondant à un bloc prédéterminé au moyen d'une conversion orthogonale inverse. Ce décodeur comprend des moyens de détection d'erreur dans les blocs (section de détection d'erreur dans les blocs (4)), permettant de vérifier au moyen d'un signal d'image défini et d'un seuil dans une région de fréquence si un bloc de données contient une erreur, et de fournir une sortie d'état de détection de données pour les blocs de données.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>